  2401   * Opens a reference fasta file as a BGZF stream, allowing for
  2402   * compressed files.  It automatically builds a .fai file if
  2403   * required and if compressed a .gzi bgzf index too.
  2404   *
  2405   * Returns a BGZF handle on success;
